    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emlis: A combat-driven metroidvania packed with secrets to uncover as you travel a corrupted world as a heroic slime.</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore unique zones </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve navigational puzzles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master combat abilities as you face a variety of enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Overcome tough boss battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decrypt secret languages as you collect hidden lore pages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slam attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022850/extras/ad84ac13c462ae67f33275e954eda11e.poster.avif?t=1750186290\" width=374 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022850/extras/ad84ac13c462ae67f33275e954eda11e.webm?t=1750186290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022850/extras/ad84ac13c462ae67f33275e954eda11e.mp4?t=1750186290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dash</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022850/extras/4acd888ba139cf02a74d3deba2c10887.poster.avif?t=1750186290\" width=374 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022850/extras/4acd888ba139cf02a74d3deba2c10887.webm?t=1750186290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022850/extras/4acd888ba139cf02a74d3deba2c10887.mp